# Copy to .env and fill in. Vite only exposes keys prefixed VITE_.
#
# Formspree form ID for the contact form (brief §B.5). Create a form at
# formspree.io — the free tier is enough — and paste the ID from the endpoint
# it gives you: https://formspree.io/f/XXXXXXXX
#
# Without this the contact form still renders, but submitting shows the
# WhatsApp/email fallback instead of pretending to send. Set it before launch.
VITE_FORMSPREE_ID=
